{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id921885614"}, "name":{"label":"conlinooo"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-07-13T19:47:12-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"2.42"}, "id":{"label":"14300452415"}, "title":{"label":"Blatant Scam"}, "content":{"label":"Pathetic. Requiring payment for something that you aren’t even able to open even once to see if it’s something you’d be interested in? I may have signed up, but now I will be subscribing to a different app that provides something in return for asking for my money. 0 Stars.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1461517107&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id49417434"}, "name":{"label":"Kippster82"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-06-28T13:52:47-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"2.41"}, "id":{"label":"14238301640"}, "title":{"label":"Bad Player"}, "content":{"label":"Unlike any other audio player in existence, this one stops completely anytime you change anything.  Say one of your airpod runs out of battery, say one falls out of your ear, say you have to take one out to itch your ear in the night…. You then have to go into the app and hit play again which in the night is blinding and a burden to do.  It will not continue to play.  Yes there is a setting that will have it play, but even that is broken: what it does is play continuously no matter what, so even if you take both of your AirPods out it’ll keep playing on the phone speaker, which interrupts my wife’s sleep in the night.  Furthermore, you have to kill the app to get it to stop, so it often ends up playing all the time!!  So you hear this noise in the day and you think what is that?… in the theater, the grocery store etc.  why can’t this be like all the other audio players in the world?  \n\n1) pause/play is controllable through the headphone’s pause/play buttons.  2) pauses only when ‘both’ EarPods are removed from the ears.\n3) can enjoy the app on more than one device without it logging me out on other devices each time I log in on a new device.\n\nTakes 2 minutes to code this yet this has been disrupting my sleep for YEARS.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1461517107&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
