{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1374994990"}, "name":{"label":"Ariha226"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-02-17T23:02:43-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"2.35"}, "id":{"label":"13761656004"}, "title":{"label":"Mesmerizing!"}, "content":{"label":"This app has been superior to all others I have tried. I pay the yearly subscription because it’s truly invaluable to myself and my daughters. \nHear me out: The sound quality couldn’t be better. There are so many to choose from. They’re clear no matter the volume or device used to listen. \nIf you like hearing a voice, need to hear an affirmation, or need help with sleep, the voice is calming and WILL get you there! \nThe images, patterns, colors, objects are vast and beautiful. \nWe use all of these for different needs and times. We’ve barely scratched the surface on all that is available. New things have been added, and this is an application I will continue using forever. \nTeachers, this is an excellent tool in the classroom for any age group!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1461517107&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
