{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id278134628"}, "name":{"label":"PHXWings"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-02-13T05:52:29-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"2.35"}, "id":{"label":"13744673605"}, "title":{"label":"Non-Functional"}, "content":{"label":"I downloaded it and signed up for the 7-day free trial and then $49.95 afterwards for an annual subscription. The first time I tried to use it, it was for sleep and it showed what looked like the inside of a slow moving water funnel. That was not going to help me sleep because of a bad childhood experience where I almost drowned. But when I tried to change the scene, the water funnel one kept showing up. I tried to change to another mode (e.g., Relax) and still the same scene! If the trial period only shows one scene then I wouldn’t trust the app. If it’s supposed to give access to multiple scenes then there’s a bug in it, and I wouldn’t trust the app. I deleted the app and canceled my subscription.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1461517107&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id106628497"}, "name":{"label":"Ertyreshuikggre"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-02-12T15:07:55-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"2.35"}, "id":{"label":"13742673154"}, "title":{"label":"Will not refund"}, "content":{"label":"I accidentally bought this app. Tried to cancel immediately. Apple will not refund. Developer has not responded to more than one direct request to cancel and refund. SO FRUSTRATING.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1461517107&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1354061841"}, "name":{"label":"utahcrowther"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-02-11T19:06:07-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"2.35"}, "id":{"label":"13739730276"}, "title":{"label":"Trial is deceptive"}, "content":{"label":"I was curious about the app and tried their trial. I was immediately billed for an entire year. You have to click past two screens that say, you will not be billed immediately, and that you will be notified before your trial ends.\nI was billed immediately, for the entire year. \n\nAlso, the visuals do not sync to the music. There are many different types of music and meditation, but none of them sync to the actual visuals on the screen. They happened at the same time, but they do not work together.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1461517107&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
