{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id38063134"}, "name":{"label":"jennacide"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-01-30T14:00:24-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"2.34"}, "id":{"label":"13694462605"}, "title":{"label":"I love this app!!!"}, "content":{"label":"Yes this app is a little bit buggy. But that doesn't stop me from opening it & scrolling through my favorite visuals any time I have some down time! Honestly I don't use the soundscapes or meditations at all. I have tried the soundscapes and they're ok but I'd rather listen to my own audio, which I do. I just like to stare at the patterns. I am a psychedelic child of the 60's!  Well about the bugs, the main one I encounter is black screens where some patterns should be, and then sometimes the app crashes too. This is when I'm scrolling through the patterns. I just open up the app again and get back to it! Mesmerize is so much fun. I think it would be even better on shrooms!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1461517107&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
